1
00:00:02,035 --> 00:00:05,994
（中央公園咖啡廳）

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,600
Out of all of us, who do you think will get married next?
我們所有人裡 你想下一個結婚的會是誰？

3
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,800
Probably Monica and Chandler.
大概是摩妮卡和錢德

4
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,610
Could I have a pack of Newport Lights?
給我一包新港淡煙？

5
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:23,750
We don't sell cigarettes, but they do across the street.
我們沒有賣煙，對街有賣

6
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:26,610
That'd be great. Thanks.
那太好了，謝謝

7
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:32,420
Melissa Worbert. I don't think I have the energy for this.
馬利莎伍伯，我沒有力氣應付她

8
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:37,390
Oh, my God! Ray-Ray Greene?
我的天！瑞瑞葛林？

9
00:00:39,339 --> 00:00:41,136
怎麼樣？！

10
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:45,540
You've been MlA for seven sorority newsletters.
你是我們社團連續7期週報主角

11
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,900
What's up with you?
你怎麼樣？

12
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,670
Why don't I tell you over here?
我們到那邊去再說？

13
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:56,140
So last I heard you were gonna get married.
上次我聽說你要結婚了

14
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,050
Poor Ray-Ray.
可憐的瑞瑞

15
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:00,880
Oh, no. It's all good.
不，其實很好

16
00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:03,960
-I actually work at Ralph Lauren. -Shut up!
-我現在替洛夫羅蘭工作 -閉嘴！

17
00:01:04,190 --> 00:01:08,220
I will not. I'm the divisional head of men's sportswear.
我不，我是男裝運動服飾的分區主管

18
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:12,090
Shut up more! Are you friends with Ralph?
再閉嘴！你是洛夫的朋友嗎？

19
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:14,730
-Oh, please. -Are you?
-拜託 -你是嗎？

20
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:16,530
No.
不是

21
00:01:17,210 --> 00:01:20,730
We have to have dinner. What are you doing tomorrow?
我們一定要一起吃飯 你明天做什麼？

22
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:24,610
-Tomorrow. I don't know. -You're having dinner with me.
-明天，我不知道 -你要和我吃晚飯

23
00:01:25,410 --> 00:01:27,070
Shut up.
閉嘴

24
00:01:27,250 --> 00:01:30,450
I've gotta go. This has been so great.
我要走了，看到你真好

25
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:33,180
Oh, there you are.
哦，這兒

26
00:01:33,390 --> 00:01:36,590
So listen, just call me. Here's my card.
打電話給我，這是我的名片

27
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:40,090
-You're in real estate? -No, that's an old card.
-你在做房地產？ -不，那是舊名片

28
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:43,850
I got out of that to do something where I could...
我必須離開那工作去做些…

29
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,730
help people and make a difference.
可以幫助別人和改變什麼的工作

30
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:48,530
What do you do now?
現在你做什麼？

31
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:51,540
I'm a party planner.
宴會規劃

32
00:01:51,770 --> 00:01:54,400
-I'll see you tomorrow. -Okay.
-明天見 -好

33
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:58,610
Look who's back. It's Ray-Ray.
看誰回來了，是瑞瑞

34
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:02,670
That was my friend, Melissa, from college.
那是我大學的朋友馬利莎

35
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:05,720
She seems really, really fun!
她看起來很有意思！

36
00:02:06,550 --> 00:02:10,120
She's actually sweet, and we used to be very close.
她真的很甜，我們曾經很親近

37
00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:14,460
Wait a minute. She's not the one who you...?
等一下，她不是那個你…？

38
00:02:14,730 --> 00:02:17,600
Who you what? Who you what?
你怎樣？你怎樣？

39
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,570
-Yes. -Wow!
-是 -哇！

40
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,400
Wow, what? Who you what?
哇，什麼？你怎樣？

41
00:02:23,610 --> 00:02:25,840
Oh, it's not a big deal.
沒什麼大不了

42
00:02:26,070 --> 00:02:27,270
They were lovers.
他們是情人

43
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,140
-What? -What?
-什麼？ -什麼？

44
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:31,340
No, we weren't. It was nothing.
不，我們不是情人，沒有什麼

45
00:02:31,610 --> 00:02:35,310
It was one night, senior year, and we went to a party...
大四的一天晚上，我們去參加舞會…

46
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:39,920
had a lot of sangria, and you know, ended up...
喝了很多桑格利塔，你知道，結果…

47
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,750
kissing for a bit.
我們接吻了

48
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:45,150
So that's two of my wives.
我的兩個老婆都是同性戀

49
00:02:46,730 --> 00:02:48,860
The One With Rachel's Big Kiss
本集播出：瑞秋的吻

00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:50,860
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

50
00:03:29,370 --> 00:03:32,830
So this is where the band is. And here's the bar.
這是樂隊的所在，這兒是吧檯

51
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:38,270
And all these pins have people's names on them. Rach, here you are.
這些大頭針上有人名 瑞秋，你在這裡

52
00:03:39,510 --> 00:03:43,140
Why don't we just put me with a Manhattan in my hand...
為什麼不給我一杯曼哈頓…

53
00:03:43,350 --> 00:03:46,340
talking to the cute bartender.
讓我和可愛的酒保聊天

54
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:52,220
These pins aren't for playing, are they?
這些大頭針不是用來玩的，是不？

55
00:03:52,490 --> 00:03:55,490
The red are my guests, and the blue are yours.
紅的是我的客人，藍色的是你的

56
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:58,530
This is so sad. I only have like 10 pins.
真可憐，我只有10個客人

57
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,670
Chandler, relax. It's not a contest.
錢德，輕鬆一點，這不是比賽

58
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:04,130
Certainly not a close one.
不是實力相近的比賽

59
00:04:11,010 --> 00:04:12,670
Hey, Rach.
瑞秋

60
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:17,050
Stop picturing it!
不要再想了！

61
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:24,350
I think that's it. The seating chart is done. This is our wedding.
我想這樣可以了，座位表好了 這是我們的婚禮

62
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:27,360
They all look like they're having fun.
他們看來玩得很開心，不是嗎

63
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:30,660
So where are my parents gonna be?
我爸媽坐哪裡？

64
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:33,920
Well, if this is the wedding hall...
如果這是結婚禮堂…

65
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:38,070
your parents would be over here at home in Queens.
你父母會在皇后區的家裡

66
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:42,400
They're not invited? Oh, no, they're gonna be crushed!
他們沒有被邀請？ 不，他們一定會很傷心！

67
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:45,240
Why would they think they're invited?
為什麼他們以為會被邀請呢？

68
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:47,880
You got me. I don't...
你問倒我了，我不…

69
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:51,250
-Joey! -Look, I thought parents were coming.
-喬伊！ -我以為父母都會來

70
00:04:51,450 --> 00:04:54,510
Your parents are coming. Chandler's are coming.
你的父母會來，錢德的父母也會來

71
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:57,160
Ross' parents are coming.
羅斯的父母也會來

72
00:04:57,360 --> 00:05:00,950
Ross' parents are my parents.
羅斯的父母就是我的父母

73
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:03,950
Well, see, parents are coming.
看，父母們都會來

74
00:05:04,670 --> 00:05:08,360
-We should invite them. -You just want more blue pins.
-我們應該請他們 -你只是想要更多的藍色大頭針

75
00:05:08,570 --> 00:05:11,060
Well, this is just sad.
這實在太慘了

76
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:16,540
All right. Maybe I can fit them in if I just do some rearranging.
好，也許能把他們排進來 不過要重新安排位子

77
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:19,210
Rachel may have to sit at the bar.
瑞秋可能要坐在吧檯

78
00:05:19,410 --> 00:05:21,940
That is not a problem.
沒有問題

79
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:26,280
-Maybe you'll order a little sangria. -Get out of here!
-也許你可以叫一杯桑格麗塔 -去你的！

80
00:05:30,290 --> 00:05:34,890
These are our tuxedos. If you like anything, we can make a deal.
這是我們的禮服 如果有你喜歡的，可以便宜些

81
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:39,760
Anything at all. But these are the three that Monica pre-approved.
全部都可以 但這三件是摩妮卡先核准的

82
00:05:40,770 --> 00:05:42,960
Thanks a lot for hooking me up.
謝謝你替我們拉到關係

83
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:48,270
And I want you to know that I want you to attend our wedding as my guest.
我想請你參加我們的婚禮做我的客人

84
00:05:50,140 --> 00:05:53,200
I'm Monica's maid of honor.
我是摩妮卡的伴娘

85
00:05:53,410 --> 00:05:56,410
Okay, don't try to blue-pin me.
別想把我變成藍色大頭針

86
00:05:57,350 --> 00:06:00,410
-Well, these look nice. -They are nice.
-這些不錯 -是不錯

87
00:06:00,620 --> 00:06:05,220
When celebrities are done with them, they send them back.
名人穿過這些之後，就送回來這兒

88
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:08,420
-You mean like for award shows? -Some of them.
-你是指像頒獎典禮之後？ -有些是

89
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:12,030
They've been down the red carpet with people yelling...
它們都上過紅地毯，被人叫著：

90
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:15,290
"Who are you wearing? You look fabulous!"
「你穿的是誰的？你看來棒極了！」

91
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:18,870
Might I suggest watching a little more ESPN...
容我建議您多看一點ESPN…

92
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:21,340
and a little less E!.
少看一點藝人八卦節目！

93
00:06:22,540 --> 00:06:24,640
Okay. Who wore those?
誰穿過這些？

94
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:29,670
-Well, this one's Tom Brokaw. -Not bad.
-這是湯姆布魯克穿過的 -不錯嘛

95
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:33,010
This one is Paul O'Neill.
這是保羅歐尼爾穿過的

96
00:06:33,290 --> 00:06:35,760
Who's that?
他是誰？

97
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:39,980
He plays for the Yankees. Seriously, ESPN.
他是洋基隊的球員 真的，多看ESPN

98
00:06:40,260 --> 00:06:43,960
Just once in a while. Have it on in the background.
有的時候，開著它當背景也好

99
00:06:46,330 --> 00:06:49,770
-This one was Pierce Brosnan. -Pierce Brosnan?
-這是皮爾斯布魯斯南穿過的 -皮爾斯布魯斯南？

100
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,160
Are you serious?
真的嗎？

101
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,290
007?
007？

102
00:06:52,540 --> 00:06:57,840
This is James Bond's tux? I have to get married in James Bond's tux.
這是詹姆士龐德的燕尾服？我一定要 穿詹姆士龐德的燕尾服結婚

103
00:06:58,050 --> 00:06:59,640
It's a pretty cool tux.
很酷

104
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:04,580
It's not just that. I would be England's most powerful weapon.
不只如此，我會是 英格蘭最強力的武器

105
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:08,920
A jet-setting heartbreaker on Her Majesty's secret service.
女王陛下的秘密特務 四處旅遊的斷腸人

106
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:13,060
A man who fears no one, with a license to kill.
有著殺人執照，什麼都不怕的男人

107
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,660
Would Monica let me wear this?
摩妮卡會不會讓我穿這件？

108
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:25,200
We should really learn how to play the real way.
我們應該學真正的玩法

109
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,670
I like our way.
我喜歡我們的玩法

110
00:07:28,910 --> 00:07:31,000
Chess!
將軍！

111
00:07:33,110 --> 00:07:35,050
-Nice move. -Yeah.
-走的好 -是啊

112
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:42,110
I hooked Ross and Chandler up with tuxedos. Do you need one?
我替羅斯和錢德找到 燕尾服，你需要嗎？

113
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,520
No, I'm not wearing a tux.
不，我不穿燕尾服

114
00:07:44,730 --> 00:07:48,530
-What are you gonna wear? -Multi-colored robes.
-你要穿什麼？ -多彩的袍子

115
00:07:48,730 --> 00:07:50,560
And maybe a hat.
也許戴一頂帽子

116
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:52,960
-Does Monica know about this? -No.
-摩妮卡知道嗎？ -不

117
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,900
Can I please be there when you tell her?
你告訴她時我可以在場嗎？

118
00:07:58,110 --> 00:08:00,340
You want to go to a movie tonight?
晚上要不要去看電影？

119
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:02,980
I'm having dinner with Melissa.
我要和馬利莎吃飯

120
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:04,970
Can I come?
我可以來嗎？

121
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:09,240
I won't talk. You'll just hear my video camera.
我不說話，你只會聽見 我的攝影機的聲音

122
00:08:09,450 --> 00:08:12,390
-What? What's going on? -Can I tell her?
-什麼？怎麼回事？ -我可以告訴她嗎？

123
00:08:12,590 --> 00:08:16,110
Do you want what happened, or Joey's lewd version?
你要真正發生的事 還是喬伊的淫蕩版本？

124
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,550
Joey's.
-喬伊的 -好

125
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:20,760
I had this college friend...
我有一個大學朋友…

126
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,930
and I made the mistake of telling Joey that one time...
我不應該告訴喬伊有一次…

127
00:08:25,170 --> 00:08:29,160
she and I, you know, kissed a little bit.
她和我接吻了

128
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:33,070
Yeah, I'm sure that happened.
是啊，我相信有的

129
00:08:33,310 --> 00:08:36,440
-It did. -Sure.
-真的 -當然

130
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:41,670
Hey. It happened.
真的發生了

131
00:08:42,950 --> 00:08:46,820
It was senior year. It was after the Sigma Chi luau...
是大四那年，那是一次社團聚會…

132
00:08:47,090 --> 00:08:49,450
and Melissa and I got very drunk.
我和馬利莎喝得大醉

133
00:08:49,690 --> 00:08:53,750
And we ended up kissing. For several minutes.
結果我們兩個接吻了 好幾分鐘呢

134
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:58,400
Which means she had a couple spritzers and a peck on the cheek.
意思是她喝了幾杯，輕輕吻在臉頰上

136
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,760
Why are you taking this away from me?
你為什麼要奪走這件事呢？

137
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,770
Why is it so hard for you to believe?
為什麼這麼難讓你相信？

138
00:09:04,970 --> 00:09:09,200
Okay. I just didn't know that you were a lesbian.
好吧，我不知道你是同性戀

139
00:09:15,050 --> 00:09:20,320
I'm not saying that I'm a lesbian. I'm just saying that this happened.
我不是說我是同性戀 我只是說那件事發生了

140
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:24,980
It just seems pretty wild. And you're so...
只是覺得很狂野，你是這麼地…

141
00:09:25,230 --> 00:09:26,220
vanilla.
乖寶寶

142
00:09:27,530 --> 00:09:32,360
Vanilla? I'm not vanilla. I do lots of crazy things.
乖寶寶？我不是乖寶寶 我做很多瘋狂的事

143
00:09:32,570 --> 00:09:35,470
I mean, I got drunk and married in Vegas.
我喝醉了，在拉斯維加斯結婚

144
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:38,300
To Ross.
和羅斯

145
00:09:38,870 --> 00:09:40,700
If you don't believe me...
如果你不相信我…

146
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:44,930
just come with me to dinner tonight and she'll tell you.
今晚和我一起去吃飯，她會告訴你

147
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:47,380
Okay. Because I can't picture it.
好吧，可是我想像不出來

148
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:50,520
You should get inside my head.
你該看看我腦袋裡的劃面

149
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:58,650
Guess what I got for your wedding?
猜我為你的婚禮弄到什麼？

150
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:01,990
A freakishly thin date with a hanger for a head?
頭像掛衣架，瘦巴巴的伴？

151
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:06,030
Rachel hooked me up with a tux. But not just any tux.
瑞秋替我弄到一件燕尾服 但不是隨便一件

152
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:08,100
Batman's tux!
是蝙蝠俠的！

153
00:10:08,770 --> 00:10:10,170
-What? -That's right.
-什麼？ -沒錯

154
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:15,340
Made expressly for Val Kilmer, and worn by him in the hit film...
特別定做給方基墨的 讓他穿在票房冠軍電影…

155
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:18,040
that Batman film he was in.
那部他演的蝙蝠俠電影裡

156
00:10:18,850 --> 00:10:22,780
You can't wear that. I'm wearing the famous tux.
你不能穿那件 我要穿名人的燕尾服

158
00:10:23,020 --> 00:10:26,710
If you wear that, it'll make mine less special.
怎樣？如果你穿那件 會讓我的不那麼特別的

159
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,290
You need something to to make it special?
你需要用一些東西來讓那天特別嗎？

160
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:32,220
You have the most special thing of all.
喂！你有了最特別的一樣

161
00:10:32,490 --> 00:10:35,620
You are marrying the woman you love.
你娶了你愛的女人

162
00:10:39,770 --> 00:10:42,860
Don't take away my cool thing. Pretty please?
不要搶走我的鋒頭，拜託囉？

163
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:47,270
"Pretty please?" Not very 007.
「拜託囉？」不怎麼007

164
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:51,640
If you were getting married, I'd never do anything to upset you.
如果你要結婚 我不會做任何讓你生氣的事

165
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:56,440
-You slept with my sister. -That was pretty 007.
-你和我妹妹上床 -那很007

166
00:11:01,290 --> 00:11:03,520
All right, I figured it out.
好，你來了 好，我想出辦法來了

167
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:06,630
I'm gonna take 2 tables of 8, add your parents...
我把8個人的這兩桌，加上你父母…

168
00:11:06,830 --> 00:11:09,130
and make them into 3 tables of 6.
變成6個人的三桌

169
00:11:09,330 --> 00:11:12,300
And I called the caterer. We are good to go!
我已經通知了辦席的人，都弄好了！

170
00:11:12,530 --> 00:11:15,130
Yeah. They're not coming.
他們不來了

171
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,590
What?
什麼？

172
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:21,430
They think that you only invited them because of me.
他們覺得你是因為我才邀請他們的

173
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,300
They feel unwanted.
他們覺得不被歡迎

174
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:27,410
That's too bad. It's true. But too bad.
真糟糕，是真的，但真糟糕

175
00:11:27,650 --> 00:11:30,170
If you could just call my mom.
你可以打電話給我媽

176
00:11:30,450 --> 00:11:33,110
Just let her know you want them there.
讓她知道你希望他們去

177
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:36,760
This is a woman who has sent you many lasagnas.
她送過你很多很多千層面

178
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:37,910
No, she hasn't.
不，她沒有

179
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:40,960
Is it her fault if some didn't make it to you?
有些沒送到你手裡不是她的錯

180
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,690
What am I gonna say?
我要說什麼？

181
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:47,560
Tell them you mixed up invitations. No, blame it on the post office.
告訴她請帖搞亂了，不，怪郵局好了

182
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:51,570
They hate the post office. And the Irish.
他們最恨郵局，還有愛爾蘭人

183
00:11:51,810 --> 00:11:55,000
But I don't think you could blame it on them.
不過我想你不能怪到他們頭上

184
00:11:57,380 --> 00:12:02,110
Hello? Yeah, hi. Mrs. Tribbianni? This is Monica Geller.
喂？你好，崔比亞尼太太？ 我是摩妮卡蓋勒

185
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:06,980
I'm just calling to say that I really hope you can make the wedding.
我想告訴你我們很希望 你們能來參加婚禮

186
00:12:07,220 --> 00:12:11,160
Apparently some of our invitations weren't delivered.
我們很多請帖都沒寄到

187
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:15,950
I guess there was some screw-up at the damn post office.
我猜又是可惡的郵局搞砸的

188
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,690
Tell me about it!
就是嘛！

189
00:12:18,970 --> 00:12:24,170
Yeah, the U.S. Post Office? No. More like U.S. Lost Office.
什麼美國郵局嘛？更像是美國遺失局

190
00:12:24,710 --> 00:12:27,400
What are they, Irish?
他們搞什麼嘛，都是愛爾蘭人嗎？

191
00:12:33,110 --> 00:12:38,180
Anyway, his name's Allen. And we've been going out for three years.
他叫艾倫，我們在一起三年了

192
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:41,620
He was my first client when I became a party planner.
他是我做宴會規劃的第一位客戶

193
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:45,990
He was actually planning a party for his girlfriend at the time.
那時他正要規劃給他女朋友的宴會

194
00:12:46,230 --> 00:12:48,200
Oh, well.
嗯

195
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:54,170
-He was Theta Beta Pi at Syracuse. -That's great.
-他是雪城大學貝塔拍社團的 -真好

196
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:57,200
-Were you ever in a sorority? -Of course.
-你參加過社團嗎？ -當然

197
00:12:57,440 --> 00:13:01,770
Yes. I was a Thigh Mega Tampon.
我是大腿大衛生棉條的成員

198
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:04,900
What one?
哪一個？

199
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:08,410
We were huge too. But they had to shut us down...
我們也很龐大，但後來被關掉了…

200
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:12,380
when Regina Phalangie died of alcohol poisoning.
因為芮吉娜菲蘭基死於酒精中毒

201
00:13:12,650 --> 00:13:16,750
Isn't it a shame when one girl ruins it for the whole bunch?
真是糟糕，一個女孩就毀了大家

202
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,960
Anyway...
不管了…

203
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:25,560
Speaking of drinking too much, I told Phoebe...
講到喝太多，我告訴菲比…

204
00:13:25,770 --> 00:13:30,400
about that crazy night after the Sigma Chi luau where we made out.
在席格□社很瘋那晚，我們親吻的事

205
00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:32,300
What?
什麼？

206
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:37,910
Remember we.. Come on, we had sarongs on and the coconut bikini tops.
記得我們…我們穿著沙龍 還有椰子殼比基尼上衣

207
00:13:38,110 --> 00:13:41,210
We went back to the house and got really silly...
之後我們回到家，在那兒瘋癲…

208
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:43,580
and we made out.
然後我們接吻了

209
00:13:43,820 --> 00:13:48,480
Wow, Ray-Ray, I have no idea what you're talking about.
瑞瑞，我不知道你在說什麼

210
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,380
Really?
真的？

211
00:13:57,500 --> 00:14:00,400
Ross is Batman.
羅斯是蝙蝠俠

212
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:06,260
Well, he did manage to keep his identity secret for a long time.
他是把身份掩護了很久

213
00:14:06,540 --> 00:14:10,870
Rachel got Ross the tuxedo that Val Kilmer wore in Batman.
瑞秋替羅斯弄到 方基墨在蝙蝠俠裡穿的燕尾服

214
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:13,840
Batman is so much cooler than James Bond.
蝙蝠俠比詹姆士龐德酷多了

215
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:19,040
-What? 007 has all those gadgets. -Batman has a utility belt.
-什麼？007有很多的工具 -蝙蝠俠有工具腰帶

216
00:14:19,250 --> 00:14:24,020
-007 has a fancy car. -Batman has the Batmobile.
-007有很炫的車 -蝙蝠俠有蝙蝠車

217
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:30,600
-007 gets all the ladies. -Batman has Robin.
-007有很多女人 -蝙蝠俠有羅賓

218
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:37,870
We get ESPN, right?
我們有ESPN台，對吧？

219
00:14:40,170 --> 00:14:45,370
How about you go put on your 007 tuxedo, and I'll make you a martini?
你何不穿上你的007燕尾服 我替你調一杯馬丁尼

220
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:47,480
I don't like martinis.
我不喜歡馬丁尼

221
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:51,450
-A Yoo-Hoo with a funny straw? -Yum.
-一杯搖搖飲料，用一隻搞笑吸管？ -好的

222
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:56,790
I know the invitation says 6 p.m.
請帖上寫晚上6點

223
00:14:57,060 --> 00:15:00,990
But does that mean get there at 6, or the show starts at 6?
是指6點入席，還是6點開始表演？

224
00:15:01,230 --> 00:15:03,290
The show?
「表演」？

225
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:08,230
Right, the wedding. Gotcha.
對，婚禮，知道了

226
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:11,700
But weddings start a little late, right?
不過婚禮會晚一點開始，對不？

227
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:14,600
Have you ever been to one of my weddings?
你有參加過我規劃的婚禮嗎？

228
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:18,970
Well, it's the same day as my niece's christening...
那天我侄女受洗…

229
00:15:19,250 --> 00:15:21,480
and I want my parents to see me.
我希望我父母能看到我

230
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:26,310
My part's in the beginning. I'm not in the rest of the show.. Wedding.
我的部份是在開始時 不在其他部份的表演…婚禮

231
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,580
The wedding starts at 6.
婚禮6點開始

232
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:31,260
Okay. I totally hear you.
好，我聽到了

233
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:34,220
How about this? I vamp till they get there.
這樣如何？我可以表演到他們到達

234
00:15:35,230 --> 00:15:36,290
You'll "vamp"?
你要「表演」？

235
00:15:36,530 --> 00:15:39,500
Like warm up the crowd. Ask where they're from.
像是和觀眾打打屁，問他們從哪兒來

236
00:15:39,730 --> 00:15:44,100
In Joey Tribbiani, you get a minister and an entertainer.
因為喬伊崔比亞尼在時 你有教士和演藝人員

237
00:15:44,310 --> 00:15:46,100
I'm a "ministainer."
我是一位「教演人」

238
00:15:47,810 --> 00:15:50,800
There's no one better. There's no one greater.
沒有更好的，沒有更偉大的

239
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:55,170
How can you not remember us kissing?
你怎能不記得我們接吻的事？

240
00:15:55,380 --> 00:16:00,010
I don't know. I don't remember a lot of things that never happened.
我不知道，我不記得那些 從沒發生過的事

241
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:05,650
Remember, we were on the sleeping porch? We couldn't stop giggling.
記得我們在睡覺的廊子裡 一直笑一直笑？

242
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:08,330
Our coconuts kept knocking together.
我們的椰子殼撞在一起

243
00:16:08,530 --> 00:16:11,860
Somewhere Joey's head is exploding.
喬伊的頭在某處爆炸了

244
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:15,360
I don't want to make you uncomfortable...
我不想讓你不舒服…

245
00:16:15,570 --> 00:16:19,770
but I told Phoebe it happened, and she doesn't believe me.
但我告訴菲比發生的事，她不相信我

246
00:16:20,010 --> 00:16:24,770
I'm sorry. I mean, if I thought it happened, I would say it.
對不起，如果我認為 它發生了，我會承認的

247
00:16:25,010 --> 00:16:29,280
Maybe I passed out and you did stuff to me while I was sleeping.
也許我昏過去了 你在我睡覺時對我做了什麼

249
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:33,810
It's okay, you don't have to do this. I believe you.
沒關係，你不必這麼做，我相信你

250
00:16:34,050 --> 00:16:37,920
If you say you kissed Melissa, then you kissed Melissa.
如果你說你吻了馬利莎 那麼你就吻了馬利莎

251
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:41,150
-Thank you, Phoebe. -Okay.
-謝謝，菲比 -好

252
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,920
-But she didn't. -I know.
-可是她沒有 -我知道

253
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:49,890
You carry that around?
你帶著它走來走去？

254
00:16:50,170 --> 00:16:53,870
I find it to be something of a conversation piece.
是的，我發現它是個好話題

255
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:58,670
-Between you and...? -Gunther.
-和…？ -阿甘

256
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,610
Why don't we put them on?
我們何不穿上？

257
00:17:00,850 --> 00:17:03,820
Get a picture of Batman and James Bond, together.
拍一張蝙蝠俠和 詹姆士龐德一起的照片

258
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:06,450
I would, but my pants are a little tight.
我很願意，但我的褲子小了一點

259
00:17:06,690 --> 00:17:11,620
A little tight? I could see 00 and 7 in those things.
小了一點？我可以看到 裡面的兩個0和一個7

260
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:16,520
I was looking forward to wearing our celebrity tuxes together.
真糟糕 我很期待我們一起穿名人燕尾服呢

262
00:17:16,730 --> 00:17:21,830
-So you're not gonna be wearing yours? - Are you kidding? It's Batman's tux!
-你不穿你的了？ -你開玩笑？是蝙蝠俠的燕尾服！

263
00:17:22,840 --> 00:17:24,900
Let me try it on.
我試穿看看

264
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:30,240
Okay. But just the jacket. 00 and 7 are not getting in there.
好，只有外套 兩個0和一個7不要進去

265
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:39,040
Holy double-vented comfort, Batman!
雙面通風的舒適，蝙蝠俠！

266
00:17:40,890 --> 00:17:42,220
What's this?
這是什麼？

267
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:45,260
An invitation to the At First Sight premiere?
《真情難捨》首映請帖？

268
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:48,390
Val Kilmer didn't wear this in Batman.
方基墨沒有在《蝙蝠俠》裡穿這件

269
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:53,590
He wore it to the premiere of a fruity love story where he was a blind guy.
他穿這件去參加 他演瞎子的那部文藝愛情片首映

270
00:17:53,870 --> 00:17:55,660
Let me see that.
給我看

271
00:17:57,100 --> 00:17:58,590
Oh, man.
老天

272
00:17:58,810 --> 00:18:03,800
The only super power you have is the slightly heightened sense of smell.
你唯一的超能力是稍微強化的嗅覺

273
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:07,770
Can I talk to you guys for a second?
可以和你們談談嗎？

274
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:10,950
I give up. Whatever you want, you can have it.
我放棄了，你要怎樣就怎樣吧

275
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:13,420
You want to sing a song or do a dance?
你要唱歌還是跳舞？

276
00:18:13,650 --> 00:18:18,750
You want your mom at the altar screaming racial slurs? I don't care.
還是要你媽在祭壇前 尖叫種族崎視的字眼？我都不在乎

277
00:18:18,990 --> 00:18:23,430
I just want to thank you guys for what you did for my parents.
我只是要謝謝你們為我父母做的一切

278
00:18:23,630 --> 00:18:27,160
They're so happy to be a part of your special day.
他們很高興能參加你們特別的一天

279
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:30,430
Tell them we're glad they're coming.
告訴他們我們很高興他們會來

280
00:18:30,670 --> 00:18:35,900
I will. Oh, check out what they got me to wear for the ceremony!
我會的，看看他們替我準備 參加婚禮的衣服！

281
00:18:39,210 --> 00:18:43,010
I wear it like this when I marry you guys. And then this...
我替你們證婚時這樣穿，然後…

282
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,720
is for party time.
在宴會時這樣穿

283
00:18:51,790 --> 00:18:55,490
It happened. I am telling you it happened.
它發生了，我告訴你它發生了

284
00:18:55,700 --> 00:18:57,530
It was great meeting you.
很高興認識你

285
00:18:57,800 --> 00:19:01,790
And, Rachel? I don't think I'll be calling you because...
瑞秋？我想我不會 打電話給你，因為…

286
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:04,490
you know, you've gotten weird.
你變得好奇怪

287
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:07,630
Take care, you guys.
保重，兩位

288
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:10,240
Wait a minute. Okay, look.
等一下，好，聽著

289
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:14,710
That night was the one wild thing I've ever done in my life.
那天晚上是我所做過 最狂野的一件事

290
00:19:14,950 --> 00:19:17,010
I won't let you take it away.
我不會讓你奪去它

291
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:21,680
So if you don't remember that, maybe you'll remember this...
如果你不記得那件事 也許你會記得這個…

292
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:32,520
Oh, my God. You love me.
我的天，你愛我

293
00:19:33,470 --> 00:19:34,460
What?
什麼？

294
00:19:34,670 --> 00:19:38,500
Of course I remember. I think about it all the time.
我當然記得，這些日子裡我一直想著它

295
00:19:38,710 --> 00:19:43,370
I can still hear the coconuts knocking together...
我還能聽到椰子殼碰在一起的聲音…

296
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:49,680
I didn't want to tell you, because I didn't think you'd return my love...
我不想告訴你，因為我不覺得 你會回報我的愛…

297
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:57,050
Look who's being suddenly shy.
看是誰突然變得害羞

298
00:19:57,260 --> 00:19:59,750
You have to feel what I feel.
你一定和我一樣感覺

299
00:19:59,990 --> 00:20:02,890
Nobody can kiss that good and not mean it.
沒人能不是真心而吻得那麼好

300
00:20:03,130 --> 00:20:06,430
I'm just a good kisser.
我的吻功很好

301
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:09,000
Shut up.
閉嘴

302
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:11,500
I'm sorry.
對不起

303
00:20:14,610 --> 00:20:18,100
You don't have to be sorry.
你不必抱歉

304
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:21,370
I'm obviously kidding.
我在開玩笑

305
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:25,750
I'm not in love with you. I'm not in love with her.
我沒愛上你，我沒愛上她

306
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:30,390
I don't hear coconuts banging together.
我沒聽到椰子殼撞在一起

307
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:35,030
I don't picture your face when I make love to my boyfriend.
我和男友做愛時沒幻想你的臉

308
00:20:35,930 --> 00:20:37,520
Anyway, I gotta go.
我要走了

309
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:39,930
A kiss goodbye?
親一下再見？

310
00:20:40,170 --> 00:20:42,930
No? Okay.
不要？好吧

311
00:20:52,610 --> 00:20:56,480
I mean, I had no idea that that would...
我不知道那會…

312
00:21:02,590 --> 00:21:03,990
What the hell was that?
這是怎麼回事？

313
00:21:04,190 --> 00:21:07,560
Just wanted to see what all the fuss was about.
想看看這一場混亂是怎麼來的

314
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:10,350
-And? -I've had better.
-然後？ -我有過更好的

315
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:20,160
I found one that fits.
我找到一件合身的

316
00:21:20,410 --> 00:21:24,940
Well, you know what they say? 23rd time's a charm.
是啊，人們常說 第23次是最好的一次

317
00:21:27,710 --> 00:21:29,940
Look at you, all handsome.
看看你，好英俊

318
00:21:30,750 --> 00:21:32,620
-Whose is it? -Does it matter?
-是誰穿過的？ -有關係嗎？

319
00:21:32,890 --> 00:21:36,190
All that matters is that you look so handsome.
唯一重要的是你看來很英俊

320
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:42,620
-Whose is it? -I don't want to say.
-是誰的？ -我不想講

321
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:46,090
Come on, I don't care. Whose is it?
